<decision #add-xnl-revisioned-persistence-primitives.revision-identity apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEG9>
  live revision 是否复用 VCS commit id 或 tree hash？
  </?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEG9>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGA>
    不复用；revision 是 persistence authority 的 opaque token。
    </?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGA>
    <decision-text ?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGB>
    Live revision 与 commit id SHALL 是不同类型、不同字段和不同生命周期。
    </?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGB>
    <rationale ?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGC>
    未提交工作区也必须支持 CAS；一次 checkpoint 也不代表调用方仍基于最新工作区。
    </?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGC>
    <evidence ?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGD>
    Mission 明确要求不把 live revision 混同 commit id；现有 Repository.commit 只表达历史对象 identity。
    </?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGD>
  )>
)>

<decision #add-xnl-revisioned-persistence-primitives.cas-owner apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGE>
  CAS 由 coordinator 通过 read + save 模拟，还是由 authority 原子实现？
  </?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGE>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGF>
    由 authority 原子实现。
    </?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGF>
    <decision-text ?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGG>
    RevisionedVfsAuthority.compareAndSwap SHALL own revision check and persistence as one authority operation。
    </?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGG>
    <rationale ?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGH>
    read 与 unchecked save 之间存在竞态，无法满足 stale writer 与失败不推进保证。
    </?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGH>
    <evidence ?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGJ>
    现有 saveSnapshot 没有 expected revision，不能作为 authoring CAS authority。
    </?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGJ>
  )>
)>

<decision #add-xnl-revisioned-persistence-primitives.checkpoint-boundary apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGK>
  每次成功 flush 是否必须创建 VCS commit？
  </?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGK>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGM>
    不强制；checkpoint 是显式的后续操作。
    </?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGM>
    <decision-text ?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGN>
    VFS flush receipt SHALL NOT contain commit identity; repository checkpoint SHALL return a distinct receipt containing both liveRevision and commitId。
    </?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGN>
    <rationale ?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGP>
    编辑保存频率与历史 checkpoint policy 不同，强绑定会让 persistence 与版本历史互相污染。
    </?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGP>
    <evidence ?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGQ>
    DEPA authority boundary 与 Mission 对 live revision/commit id 的显式区分。
    </?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGQ>
  )>
)>

<decision #add-xnl-revisioned-persistence-primitives.compatibility apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P1" } (
  <question ?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGR>
  是否直接改变现有 saveSnapshot、commit 的返回签名？
  </?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGR>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGS>
    保持兼容，新增显式 revisioned API。
    </?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGS>
    <decision-text ?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGT>
    Existing VFS persistence and Repository APIs SHALL remain source-compatible; revisioned semantics SHALL use new exports。
    </?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGT>
    <rationale ?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGV>
    现有 package consumers 尚未声明 revision protocol，隐式改变会形成无关 breaking change。
    </?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGV>
    <evidence ?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGW>
    xnl-vfs/xnl-vcs 0.1.1 已公开 saveSnapshot、saveFromVfs 与 Repository.commit。
    </?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGW>
  )>
)>

<decision #add-xnl-revisioned-persistence-primitives.authority-qualified-revision apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGX>
  opaque revision 是否只包含 value？
  </?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGX>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGY>
    必须同时携带 authorityId，防止跨 authority token 误接受。
    </?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGY>
    <decision-text ?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGZ>
    VfsRevision SHALL be an authority-qualified opaque object with authorityId and value。
    </?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEGZ>
    <rationale ?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEH0>
    不同 authority 都可能从 revision:0 开始，仅比较 value 会形成 false CAS success。
    </?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEH0>
    <evidence ?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEH1>
    Fresh coding AttractorCheck 发现 cross-authority scope 未进入 read/base/CAS contract。
    </?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEH1>
  )>
)>

<decision #add-xnl-revisioned-persistence-primitives.checkpoint-durability apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEH2>
  现有 Repository checkpoint 失败是否能保证 history 未推进？
  </?01M1W1C2DFWEEHAQ8NQ2CGKEH2>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH188X>
    不能；需要 Repository 自身 backend capability 证明 truthful durability，并在未知时返回 indeterminate。
    </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH188X>
    <decision-text ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH188Y>
    Checkpoint SHALL bind the exact authority snapshot; backend-flushed SHALL require the same Repository backend's successful flush plus proof that active object/content stores are that backend's ports。
    </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH188Y>
    <rationale ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH188Z>
    Repository 可覆盖 backend store；任意外部 flush 或 flush 不同 stores 都无法证明持久化了 active object/content/ref/workspace。
    </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH188Z>
    <evidence ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH1890>
    Repository.commit、LocalFsRepositoryBackend.updateBranchHead 与 IndexedDbRepositoryBackend.flush 的实际顺序。
    </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH1890>
  )>
)>

<decision #add-xnl-revisioned-persistence-primitives.checkpoint-result-union apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH1891>
  Checkpoint 失败如何避免把未知历史状态误报为确定失败？
  </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH1891>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH1892>
    使用 checkpointed/conflict/failed/indeterminate 封闭 union；historyState 与 worktreeState 正交，restore failure 单独归入 indeterminate。
    </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH1892>
    <decision-text ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH1893>
    Repository checkpoint SHALL distinguish known pre-commit failure from potentially accepted or restore-indeterminate outcomes and SHALL expose history/worktree evidence。
    </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH1893>
    <rationale ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH1894>
    Repository/backend 可能先推进内存 head 或接受 commit，再在 restore、验证或 flush 时失败；统一 failed 会伪造回滚保证。
    </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH1894>
    <evidence ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH1895>
    Fresh AttractorCheck 对 Repository commit/backend/flush 时序的审查。
    </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH1895>
  )>
)>

<decision #add-xnl-revisioned-persistence-primitives.snapshot-equality apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH1896>
  authority no-op 与 checkpoint verification 是否复用 diffNodes？
  </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH1896>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH1897>
    不复用；使用独立的 identity-sensitive AST structural equality。
    </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH1897>
    <decision-text ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH1898>
    Snapshot equality SHALL compare every AST field including explicit #id and metadata fallback while diffNodes remains an alignment/move operation。
    </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH1898>
    <rationale ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH1899>
    diff 按设计不把 #id 当 ordinary payload；用它判断持久化 no-op 会把 identity replacement 误报 unchanged。
    </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH1899>
    <evidence ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189A>
    Fresh AttractorCheck 证明只替换根 #id 时双向 diff 都为空；用户已确认该 diff 语义本身正确。
    </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189A>
  )>
)>

<decision #add-xnl-revisioned-persistence-primitives.lossless-tree apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189B>
  exact authority snapshot 是否可以继续使用现有 legacy tree projection？
  </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189B>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189C>
    不能；v2 root tree 携带完整 lossless snapshot payload，旧 entries 只作投影且旧对象继续 fallback 读取。
    </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189C>
    <decision-text ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189D>
    Repository.commitSnapshot SHALL use a versioned root-tree snapshot payload that preserves every XNL AST variant and survives RepositorySnapshot serialization。
    </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189D>
    <rationale ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189E>
    legacy tree converter 合并 metadata/attributes 且丢失 element #id，无法通过 exact round-trip。
    </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189E>
    <evidence ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189F>
    Fresh AttractorCheck 对 packages/vcs/src/tree-converter.ts 与 TreeObject/TreeEntry 的实测审查。
    </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189F>
  )>
)>

<decision #add-xnl-revisioned-persistence-primitives.strict-coordinator-surface apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P1" } (
  <question ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189G>
  browser-safe coordinator 是否同时接受 legacy VfsMutation？
  </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189G>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189H>
    不接受；只接受 XnlMutationBatch 与移除 metadataIdMode 的 options，运行时固定 identity mode。
    </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189H>
    <decision-text ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189J>
    The browser-safe coordinator SHALL omit caller-controlled metadataIdMode, force metadataIdMode=identity at runtime, and terminate in strict dryRunMutations。
    </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189J>
    <rationale ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189K>
    完整 XnlMutationBatchOptions 可切回 metadata mode，关闭 VFS effective fallback identity guard；legacy VfsMutation bridge 还依赖 Node path/crypto 路径。
    </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189K>
    <evidence ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189M>
    Fresh AttractorCheck 的传递依赖与 metadata.id mutation path 审查。
    </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189M>
  )>
)>

<decision #add-xnl-revisioned-persistence-primitives.checkpoint-worktree apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189N>
  提交 exact authority snapshot 时如何处理 Repository 的 public worktree？
  </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189N>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189P>
    使用 source-compatible commitSnapshot 临时 staging，并在 finally 恢复原 worktree；history 结果独立判定。
    </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189P>
    <decision-text ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189Q>
    Repository checkpoint SHALL restore its public worktree after exact-snapshot staging and SHALL report worktree restoration independently from commit-history certainty。
    </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189Q>
    <rationale ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189R>
    现有 commit 只能读取 repo.vfs 且可能先推进 head；临时覆盖若不恢复，会让 checkpoint 越权成为编辑态 writer。
    </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189R>
    <evidence ?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189S>
    Fresh AttractorCheck 对 Repository.commit 与 backend update 时序的审查。
    </?01M1W1C2DGQ7YHDMD91MEH189S>
  )>
)>
